{
  "declaredLength": 8460,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "No creo que las opciones B y C estén mal,\npero yo me decantaría por la opción A.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yo creo que tanto la opción A como la C no tienen\nel impacto de la B. Esta última es la mejor.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mi propuesta, la C, es a todas luces la mejor.\nPero está visto que os negáis.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Y cómo nos vamos a decidir entonces?\n¿Os parece bien que preguntemos a est<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāea joven?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Buena idea! Porque nosotros tres estamos\nerre que erre y no nos ponemos de acuerdo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oye, perdona. ¡Sí, tú! ¿Nos puedes ayudar?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00790065002C00200070006500720064006F006E0061002E002000A1005300ED002C0020007400FA0021002000BF004E006F007300200070007500650064006500730020006100790075006400610072003F00100002011401B40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Esta calle no tiene mal nombre, pero tampoco\nes como para tirar cohetes, que se diga.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Queremos ponerle uno nuevo que llame la\natención de la gente. Así estará más concurrida.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y de ahí que queramos preguntarte a ti.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLos jóvenes sois quienes heredaréis esta ciudad\nen un futuro cercano.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 117
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A cada uno de nosotros se le ha ocurrido\nun nombre diferente para la calle.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 2104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La opción A es <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Gran Vía Luminalia<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSi le ponemos un nombre tan grandioso, seguro\nque llamará la atención de la gente.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 133
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La opción B es <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Calle Megaevolución<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nNo tiene nada que ver con la megaevolución,\npero es mi propuesta y suena bien.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 130
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La opción C es <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Calle del Montón<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.\nNo es que haya mucho que ver, al fin y al cabo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Las tres opciones tienen su qué y no logramos\ndecidirnos, estamos atascados.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nComo si fuéramos de tipo Fuego, Agua y Planta\ny nos canceláramos los unos a los otros.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 171
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué me dices? ¿Nos ayudarás a decidir?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 3324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E90020006D0065002000640069006300650073003F002000BF004E006F0073002000610079007500640061007200E100730020006100200064006500630069006400690072003F00100002011401B30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 3412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Has pensado en qué nombre deberíamos\nponerle a esta calle?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 3424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF004800610073002000700065006E007300610064006F00200065006E00200071007500E90020006E006F006D00620072006500200064006500620065007200ED0061006D006F0073000A0070006F006E00650072006C00650020006100200065007300740061002000630061006C006C0065003F00100002011401B20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ya lo sé",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 3552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005900610020006C006F0020007300E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Todavía no",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F00640061007600ED00610020006E006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vaya, ¡te estaremos muy agradecidos!\n¿Por cuál te has decantado al final?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Opción A: Gran Vía Luminalia",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00700063006900F3006E00200041003A0020004700720061006E0020005600ED00610020004C0075006D0069006E0061006C006900610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Opción B: Calle Megaevolución",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00700063006900F3006E00200042003A002000430061006C006C00650020004D00650067006100650076006F006C00750063006900F3006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Opción C: Calle del Montón",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00700063006900F3006E00200043003A002000430061006C006C0065002000640065006C0020004D006F006E007400F3006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Prefiero daros otra opción",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050007200650066006900650072006F0020006400610072006F00730020006F0074007200610020006F00700063006900F3006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Gran Vía Luminalia, claro que sí!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nQuizá no le haga aún honor a su nombre,\npero algún día representará a Ciudad Luminalia.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 130
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Calle Megaevolución, pues claro!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYa verás como circulará el rumor de que aquí\nfue donde se descubrió el fenómeno.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 4244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 122
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Calle del Montón, por supuesto. Las cosas por\nsu nombre.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430061006C006C0065002000640065006C0020004D006F006E007400F3006E002C00200070006F007200200073007500700075006500730074006F002E0020004C0061007300200063006F00730061007300200070006F0072000A007300750020006E006F006D006200720065002E00100002011401B40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿Cómo?! ¡¿No te convence ninguna de nuestras\npropuestas y quieres aportar otra?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Así que Vía <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0002>...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007300ED00200071007500650020005600ED006100200010000201000002002E002E002E00100002011401B30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Anda, pues me parece muy buena idea.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E00640061002C002000700075006500730020006D006500200070006100720065006300650020006D007500790020006200750065006E006100200069006400650061002E00100002011401B20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estoy de acuerdo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500730074006F00790020006400650020006100630075006500720064006F002E00100002011401B30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yo también opino lo mismo. Esa sí que no es\nuna idea del montón.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F002000740061006D0062006900E9006E0020006F00700069006E006F0020006C006F0020006D00690073006D006F002E00200045007300610020007300ED00200071007500650020006E006F002000650073000A0075006E006100200069006400650061002000640065006C0020006D006F006E007400F3006E002E00100002011401B40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dicho y hecho: la rebautizaremos como\nVía <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0002>.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 5100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006900630068006F0020007900200068006500630068006F003A0020006C006100200072006500620061007500740069007A006100720065006D006F007300200063006F006D006F000A005600ED006100200010000201000002002E00100002011401B30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dicho y hecho: la rebautizaremos como\nGran Vía Luminalia.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 5204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006900630068006F0020007900200068006500630068006F003A0020006C006100200072006500620061007500740069007A006100720065006D006F007300200063006F006D006F000A004700720061006E0020005600ED00610020004C0075006D0069006E0061006C00690061002E00100002011401B30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dicho y hecho: la rebautizaremos como\nCalle Megaevolución.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 5328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006900630068006F0020007900200068006500630068006F003A0020006C006100200072006500620061007500740069007A006100720065006D006F007300200063006F006D006F000A00430061006C006C00650020004D00650067006100650076006F006C00750063006900F3006E002E00100002011401B30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dicho y hecho: la rebautizaremos como\nCalle del Montón.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006900630068006F0020007900200068006500630068006F003A0020006C006100200072006500620061007500740069007A006100720065006D006F007300200063006F006D006F000A00430061006C006C0065002000640065006C0020004D006F006E007400F3006E002E00100002011401B30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ojalá este nombre cale entre los habitantes\nde Ciudad Luminalia...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006A0061006C00E1002000650073007400650020006E006F006D006200720065002000630061006C006500200065006E0074007200650020006C006F00730020006800610062006900740061006E007400650073000A0064006500200043006900750064006100640020004C0075006D0069006E0061006C00690061002E002E002E00100002011401B40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿%",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vía <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0002> suena bien, la verdad.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005600ED0061002000100002010000020020007300750065006E00610020006200690065006E002C0020006C00610020007600650072006400610064002E00100002011401B20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Espero que actualicen el mapa cuanto antes\ncon Vía <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0002>.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007000650072006F0020007100750065002000610063007400750061006C006900630065006E00200065006C0020006D0061007000610020006300750061006E0074006F00200061006E007400650073000A0063006F006E0020005600ED006100200010000201000002002E00100002011401B30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estaría bien que se la reconociera oficialmente\ncomo Vía <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0002>...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007300740061007200ED00610020006200690065006E00200071007500650020007300650020006C00610020007200650063006F006E006F006300690065007200610020006F00660069006300690061006C006D0065006E00740065000A0063006F006D006F0020005600ED006100200010000201000002002E002E002E00100002011401B40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vía <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0002>\nsuena bien.<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 6068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005600ED006100200010000201000002000A007300750065006E00610020006200690065006E002E00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Esta es la Vía\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0002>.<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 6140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007400610020006500730020006C00610020005600ED0061000A0010000201000002002E00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Espero que venga mucha\ngente a la Vía <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0002>.<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 6212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007000650072006F0020007100750065002000760065006E006700610020006D0075006300680061000A00670065006E00740065002000610020006C00610020005600ED006100200010000201000002002E00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gran Vía Luminalia suena bien, la verdad.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700720061006E0020005600ED00610020004C0075006D0069006E0061006C006900610020007300750065006E00610020006200690065006E002C0020006C00610020007600650072006400610064002E00100002011401B20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Espero que actualicen el mapa cuanto antes\ncon Gran Vía Luminalia.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007000650072006F0020007100750065002000610063007400750061006C006900630065006E00200065006C0020006D0061007000610020006300750061006E0074006F00200061006E007400650073000A0063006F006E0020004700720061006E0020005600ED00610020004C0075006D0069006E0061006C00690061002E00100002011401B30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
